      "local_deviation": "Local Desktop keeps registry list and enablement UI, but Snapshot v4 closes the route until the observed sidecar response is revision-bound. Install, reload, uninstall, catalog, schema, plugin configuration and channel configuration remain outside the Local authority.",
      "local_entries": [
        "agi-stack/apps/desktop/src/App.tsx",
