      ],
      "judgment_rationale": "Web tenant plugin reads and mutations are authorized independently from project channel configuration reads, tests and mutations. Desktop now has a real canonical loader, App binding, management state controller and the existing native plugin dialogs in both modes. Cloud preserves the tenant and project role separation, while Local remains limited to registry list and admin-or-owner enable or disable. The management observation used by Snapshot v4 has no authority revision, so neither Desktop surface may be promoted and both remain capability_authority_revision_unavailable until the typed authority becomes revision-bound."
